        <li>Bronze Stallion: “Horse Run Cycle On Place” by Amitesh Nandan (Sketchfab), licensed <a class="underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-paper" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CC BY-ND 4.0</a>. Used in the app only.</li>
        <li>Icons: Flaticon UIcons.</li>
        <li>Campus photos: ExploreNDMU team.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-white/5 py-6 text-xs text-mute/80 md:flex-row md:justify-between">
    <p>© {year} Amoran, Herradura, Villanueva · Notre Dame of Marbel University</p>
